.. rubric:: Outputs (no circuit port)

This ideal impressed-current source does not create a circuit port, S11 or
input impedance. Add ``Rx`` / ``#rx`` for field or Ampere-loop observations,
or an NTFF request for transformed fields. Raw field/source ratios are not
power-wave S-parameters. See :doc:`sources_ports` for source selection and
:ref:`study-gpr` for point-source acquisition schedules.
